<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Orbotech raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Orbotech raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers analyst Victor Halpert said he raised his rating on Orbotech Ltd to strong buy from buy and set an 18-month price range for the stock of $22-$25.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We believe that Orbotech continues to demonstrate strong operating performance in most of its market segments,&quot; Halpert said in a research note.</p>
<p>&quot;In addition, its business fundamentals appear to be strong and the launch of new products over the next few quarters should diversify the company's revenue base.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Orbotech shares were up 7/8 at 13-5/8.</p>
</text>
